('where-is-my-train','kozhikode','Where is my Train','Transport','W','#2867A8','Check Indian train timetables and running status, including offline features.','https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.whereismytrain.android','Multiple Indian languages','No account needed for basic train information','Check the official store listing for current terms','This is an independent app, not an Indian Railways service. Verify critical changes with railway staff or official channels.','2026-10-11','17'),
